</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d1462964-d9f1-11f1-8b86-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/PHOTO-JOSEP-BORRELL-1.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d1462964-d9f1-11f1-8b86-695cb59fade5/w:1024/p:16x9/PHOTO-JOSEP-BORRELL-1.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b329fcd4-d6af-11f1-af0c-4789fb9a1a2f</guid><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:44:19 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Jennifer BEN BRAHIM</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
